   "severity": "medium",
   "title": "D-pad auto-repeat adds a step when the release arrives late",
   "detail": "Holding a D-pad key repeated after 320-380 ms; when touchEnd was delayed (slow device / heavy load) one tap moved two cells. doubleCounted pushes: skilled 13, casual 12, clumsy 6, world 5, superhuman 1 (superhuman uses exact 16 ms taps).",
   "repro": "Tap a D-pad key with a delayed touchEnd (CDP under load): moves +2."
  },
  {
   "severity": "medium",
   "title": "Par (標準) far too loose on late levels",
   "detail": "Stored solutions came from a push-space greedy solver and wasted walking: L56 par 135 (50 possible), L100 par 424 (253 possible). World bot got 3 stars on L100 with 340 moves; stars meant little after chapter 3.",
   "repro": "Level 100: finish in 340 moves -> 3 stars."
  },
  {
   "severity": "medium",
   "title": "Tap-to-walk misses on large rooms",
